# Cursor models only

- Run this chat and every worker with a **Cursor** model only:
  `composer-2.5`, `composer-2.5-fast`, `cursor-grok-4.6-*`, `muse-spark-1.3-*`.
- When launching a worker, omit `model` (inherit) or pass one of those slugs.
  Never pass `claude-*`, `gpt-*`, `gemini-*`, or another vendor slug.
- If the user asks for a non-Cursor model, refuse that substitution and stay
  on a Cursor model. Do not silently pick Claude, GPT, or Gemini instead.

```text
# BAD — worker on Claude
CreateAgent model=claude-sonnet-5-thinking-medium

# GOOD — inherit, or pin a Cursor slug
CreateAgent
CreateAgent model=cursor-grok-4.6-medium
```
